# Elcroki (22214, level 80; silhouettes 22209), every draw 0, in combat with two silhouettes counted (int slot 3 at 2,
# slot 4 at 2) and the character its top desire target: the death of one silhouette brings two more (slot 3 back to 1,
# then 3; slot 4 to 4), told (1000, the character).
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
